# The build context is the repository root. Send only what deploy/api.Dockerfile copies: the workspace
# members (uv needs all of them to check uv.lock) without their tests, and the fixture data.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/
packages/*
!packages/vestagraph-*/
!packages/fixtures/
packages/fixtures/*
!packages/fixtures/data/
**/tests
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/mutants
**/.env*
**/.*_cache
**/.artifacts
**/.hypothesis
